      "note": "Week 2 gutted rosters across the league. Adrian Peterson was deactivated over a child-abuse charge and Jamaal Charles went down on his second carry with an ankle injury. Ray Rice had already been released and then suspended for the whole season once the TMZ video came out, leaving anyone who drafted him with nothing. Josh Gordon's second failed drug test cost him most of the year, and Sam Bradford tore an ACL before the season even started.",
