      "note": "A season remembered for how many of the top picks went down. Dez Bryant broke his foot in week 1 and missed six weeks. Jamaal Charles, the second-ranked player in drafts, tore an ACL in October after only five games. Le'Veon Bell had already served a two-game suspension to start the year and then tore his MCL in week 9, ending his season. Andrew Luck missed five weeks and Justin Forsett's season ended in week 11.",
